+# Frozen run plan — SB-T0.v1
+
+User-authorized coordinator; no new run is launched. The September 22 sparse sampling objective supersedes the local-chain objective in AGENTS.md/GOAL_SPEC.md and predates HANDOFF/manuscript updates. Those documents remain untouched. All research writes belong here.
+
+Target is global uniform U(N,m) on ordered, labeled transposition identity words, with (ab)(x)=a(b(x)). N>=2, m even, P=N+m+2, and K=max{1<=v<=N:v^(2v)<=P^4}, computed once at the original input. A component has length 2v-2+2g. H0 admits g<=1 OR v<=K (set A); H1 admits v<=K (set B). Isolates are separate. Small supports admit every genus.
+
+T0: one expected-poly(N,m)-bit-time algorithm always returns a length-m identity word, with one explicit negligible eta(N) uniformly for every even m with m^4<=N^3. P0 and P1 ask this separately for unchanged H0 and H1. Their exact errors are 1-|A|/|Omega| and 1-|B|/|Omega|. A smaller extension must have its own version and does not prove T0. Fixed inverse powers and o(1) are insufficient. Negative results about these policies are not sampling hardness.
+
+Five fresh worker contexts, requested gpt-6-astra/ultra, no worker delegation or competing goals: R1 upper bounds; R2 H0 obstruction; R3 exact diagnostics; R4 one connected-sampler modification; R5 blind referee. Blind intake is limited to the supplied brief and operational/safety instructions until its report freezes. Coordinator audits dependencies, reconciles reports, reruns decisive tests and maintains the ledger.
+
+Authoritative UTC on 2026-09-22: activation 09:25:28.937730; halfway 09:45:28; blind freeze 09:55:28; construction snapshots 10:00:28; wrap-up 10:15:28.937730; deliverables 10:20:28; graceful shutdown 10:24:23.937730; hard deadline 10:25:28.937730. Sidecar and tmux-run.json must be reread on continuation, never reset. Checkpoints every ten minutes and after major findings. No new construction after wrap-up.
+
+Supervised exact standard-library computations start with timeout 90s; at most two expensive checks at once. R3 initially holds one slot. Hash before importing old code, Python -B; no old-file mutation. Seeds 1729,2718,31415 only if needed. Required boundaries: m0,m2,odd,N1,N2, near-minimal, fixed-cutoff recursion, arbitrary genus small support and zero-count branches. Finite counts are falsification/implementation checks, not asymptotic proofs.
+
+Terminal gate: an audited new extension or an audited asymptotic H0 obstruction with all load-bearing obligations closed, current-version nonauthor checks, decisive tests, blind report and saved final artifacts. Otherwise preserve partial progress and leave the native goal unfinished at cap. No native budget was requested.
