+Coordinator read canonical prior proof and current ledger, checked the DYZ primary-source recurrence/normalization, and is auditing imported assumptions. Workers independently pursue upper bounds, H0 obstruction, exact counts, one construction and blind review. Next checkpoint no later than09:39 UTC.
+
+2026-09-22 09:37 UTC (~12 min). Two concrete results await final cross-audit. R2-O1 proves a full-H0 counting obstruction at N=2^(8j),m=2^(6j),j>=64 with retained mass<=2^(-1-jm/2). Root read every step and rederived its imported factorial majorant from the primary DYZ recurrence. R1 UPPER.v2 retains the falling factorial and finite genus to obtain the smaller positive range m<=N^(2/3)ln N/4, threshold2^2048, eta exp[-ln²N/(48lnlnN)]. R5 froze its blind report at09:34:39, independently deriving an even stronger all-m_star obstruction via a different low-genus count bound. It has now received exact candidate paths for nonauthor review.
